menu "HiPhi RLCD Defaults"

config RK_RLCD_DEEP_SLEEP
    bool "Enable fail-awake RLCD ESP32-S3 Deep-sleep policy"
    default y
    help
        After the configured battery idle timeout, quiesce BLE and Wi-Fi,
        put the ST7305 into Sleep In, and enter ESP32-S3 Deep-sleep. GPIO18
        KEY wakes the exact Waveshare ESP32-S3-RLCD-4.2 target.

endmenu
